&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 372px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;■監督と執行の分離による経営の監督機能の強化&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;■権限委譲の拡大による意思決定の迅速化&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 26.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 180px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;地政学リスク・サプライチェーンリスク対応&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 372px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;■グローバルな最適地生産体制の確立&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;■地産地消型生産の推進&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
